Package: pulzr-ble
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Provides: pulzr-cap-ble
Description: Bluetooth LE on the board's radio or a USB dongle, on pulzr-edge.
 Scans passively and sends each beacon it is told to listen for to Pulzar Net
 as its own device (Pulzar protocol v1), which decodes it with the device
 type's codec; GATT and advertising on request. Off until turned on from
 Pulzar Net or the console (docs/bluetooth.md).
